    skos:notation "somatosensory" ;
    skos:definition "Body-perceived sensation including touch, vibration, pressure, proprioception, or related body sensation."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Superordinate body-sense channel: the tactile percept (sstim-ex:modalityTactile) is a sub-modality, the haptic actuator is the device path, and vibrotactile is the mechanism (P5.5 convention; ADR 0019)."@en ;
    skos:closeMatch sstim-v:modalitySomatosensory .

sstim-ex:modalityInteroceptive a owl:NamedIndividual, sstim-ex:PerceivedModality, skos:Concept ;
